{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21212","headline":"送王十一南行 · 元稹","name":"送王十一南行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夏水漾天末，晚阳依岸邨。\n风调乌尾劲，眷恋余芳尊。\n解袂方瞬息，征帆已翩翻。\n江豚涌高浪，枫树摇去魂。\n远戍宗侣泊，暮烟洲渚昏。\n离心讵几许，骤若移寒温。\n此别信非久，胡爲坐忧烦。\n我留石难转，君泛云无根。\n万里湖南月，三声山上猿。\n从兹耿幽梦，夜夜湘与沅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21212.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21212","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}